  Major (1)                                                                                           C         DI
  Minor or limited (2)                                                                                S
Yersinia enterocolitica gastroenteritis (see gastroenteritis)
  Localized in immunocompromised patient, disseminated                                                A,C       DI (13)
  Localized in normal patient                                                                         S (13)
